---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';

const updated = '27 September 2026';
---

<Layout title={`Privacy policy | ${site.name}`} description="How danienell.com and Danie Nell's private Blackbox tool handle personal data.">
	<article class="prose prose-zinc max-w-none text-base leading-7 text-zinc-800 prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-black prose-a:text-black prose-a:underline prose-a:decoration-zinc-400 hover:prose-a:decoration-black">
		<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
		<p class="text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated {updated}</p>

		<p>
			This policy covers this website and <strong>Blackbox</strong>, a private tool I run for my own use.
			I am Danie Nell, the data controller, and you can reach me at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>This website</h2>
		<p>
			danienell.com is a static site. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics or advertising trackers,
			and has no forms or accounts. It is served through Cloudflare, which processes standard request data
			(such as your IP address and browser details) to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.
			See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
		</p>
		<p>If you email me, I use your message and address only to reply and keep a record of our conversation.</p>

		<h2>Blackbox (Google sign-in)</h2>
		<p>
			Blackbox is a personal assistant that I use only with my own Google accounts. It is not offered to the public,
			and nobody else can sign in to it.
		</p>
		<p>With my permission, it reads and manages data in those accounts through Google's APIs:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Gmail: reading, organising and drafting email</li>
			<li>Google Calendar: reading and updating events</li>
			<li>Google Contacts: read-only</li>
			<li>Google Drive: finding, filing and creating documents</li>
			<li>Google Fit: read-only activity and body measurements</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			This data is stored on servers I own and control, and is used only to provide features to me,
			such as search, summaries, reminders and filing. It is not sold, not used for advertising, and not shared
			with anyone except the service providers needed to run those features for me.
		</p>
		<p>
			Blackbox's use of information received from Google APIs follows the
			<a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>,
			including the Limited Use requirements.
		</p>
		<p>
			Access can be withdrawn at any time from
			<a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google Account permissions</a>.
			When access is removed, the stored credentials stop working and synced data is deleted on request.
		</p>

		<h2>Your rights</h2>
		<p>
			Under UK data protection law you can ask for a copy of any personal data I hold about you, and ask me to correct
			or delete it. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You can also complain to the
			<a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Information Commissioner's Office</a>.
		</p>
	</article>
</Layout>
